l($wradmin_info[0] . ' ' . $wradmin_info[1]); ?></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></fieldset></div><div class="wradmin-setup-preview"><img src="<?php echo esc_url(WRADMIN_PLUGIN_URL . 'admin/images/setup-bot.svg'); ?>" alt="" width="100" height="100"><div class="wradmin-setup-bubble"><strong id="wradmin-preview-name"><?php echo esc_html($wradmin_settings->get_bot_name()); ?></strong><p id="wradmin-preview-message"></p></div></div></div></section>
